Vulkanstorm tools licence
=========================

The tools on this branch (Skin Studio, tools/skin-editor) are part of
Vulkanstorm and are licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3
or (at your option) any later version (GPL-3.0-or-later; GPL-3.0-license.txt in
this folder).

The exact terms differ by origin:

  * Skin Studio's code (Python, JavaScript, HTML/CSS and the Rust desktop
    app), written for Vulkanstorm:
        SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
  * The skin library (tools/skin-editor/library: XUI definitions, themes,
    localized labels and commands.xml), copied from the Vulkanstorm viewer
    and so from Linden Lab and Firestorm. They release it under LGPL-2.1
    only (LGPL-2.1-license.txt in this folder; their headers are unchanged);
    Vulkanstorm uses it under the ordinary GNU GPL, as section 3 of LGPL-2.1
    allows.
  * Artwork in the skin library keeps its own terms: Linden Lab's viewer
    artwork is under CC BY-SA 3.0 with its trademarks excluded
    (LICENSE-logos.txt in this folder); other skin artwork keeps
    its authors' terms. The licences above do not cover artwork or
    trademarks.
  * Third-party Rust crates and the bundled Python runtime keep their own
    licences (shipped in the desktop bundle's licenses/ folder).

NOTICE.md in the source tree explains the groups.

Source code: https://github.com/anne-skydancer/vulkanstorm (branch vkstorm-tools)
